  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.出法兰城西门至（245.210）处附近寻找随机出现黄色传送石，进入后抵达迷路之穴。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆迷路之穴为随机迷宫，约8~11层；魔物为Lv.5~9风蜘蛛、液态史莱姆",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.在迷宫内寻找随机出现的马欧希亚，由见习职业队员与之对话，选“是”获得20G。",
      "type": "career-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.由见习职业持有【面包】与之对话，交出1个【面包】获得50G。再与之对话交出1个【法国面包】获得【马达塞特】。",
      "type": "multi-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "4.将【马达塞特】交易给传教士职业队员（和职业阶段无关），由传教士职业队员与马欧西亚对话，交出【马达塞特】获得【马达塞特】。",
      "type": "same-name-state-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆若为见习传教士，则可替代第2、3步内的见习职业；后续步骤亦如此",
      "type": "career-alternative",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "5.将【马达塞特】交易给医生或护士职业队员（和职业阶段无关），由医生或护士职业队员与马欧西亚对话，交出【马达塞特】获得【马欧希亚的信】（可交易）。",
      "type": "career-state-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆若为见习医生或护士，则可替代第2、3步内的见习职业；后续步骤亦如此",
      "type": "career-alternative",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "6.将【马欧希亚的信】交易给之前交出【面包】的见习职业队员（必须交还给最初给面包的见习生，否则任务无法继续）。",
      "type": "identity-transfer",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "7.前往伊尔村村长的家，由持有【马欧希亚的信】的见习职业队员与村长尼卡托（21.6）对话，交出【马欧希亚的信】获得【马欧希亚的信】（不可交易）。",
      "type": "same-name-state-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "8.返回迷路之穴与马欧希亚对话，交出【马欧希亚的信】获得【马欧希亚的信】。",
      "type": "same-name-state-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "9.前往圣拉鲁卡村村长的家（49.81）2楼与匿名的老人（5.1）对话（需解散队伍），交出【马欧希亚的信】并传送至赛杰利亚酒吧。",
      "type": "solo-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "与玛欧希雅（9.4）对话，获得【马达塞特】并传送出酒吧。",
      "type": "reward-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆【马达塞特】：Lv.1项链；HP+15~25、MP+10~15，耐久80~100；可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "10.前往法兰城里谢里雅堡2楼谒见之间与地域防犯推进会长（12.12）对话，交出【马达塞特】获得【闪亮的白银之魂】或【闪亮之心】及【星型项链】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆重解：任务必须解完之后，才可重解",
      "type": "repeat-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆奖励详细：",
      "type": "reward-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "⑴【星型项链】：Lv.1项链；HP+15~25、MP+10~15，耐久80~100；可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "⑵【闪亮的白银之魂】：Lv.1书；双击获得称号“光辉的白银之魂” ；可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "⑶【闪亮之心】：Lv.1书；双击获得称号“闪亮之心”；可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆同时拥有两个称号：",
      "type": "dual-title-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "拥有不同的两本书，可使用变身技能或变身卡同时获得两个称号，否则只能获得一个称号",
      "type": "dual-title-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "（过程为，角色本身形象，使用一本书，获得1个称号，",
      "type": "dual-title-process",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "然后变身或使用变身卡，变成另外一个称号需要的角色形象，使用另外一本书，获得第二个称号）",
      "type": "dual-title-process",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "◆获得【闪亮的白银之魂】或【闪亮之心】：",
      "type": "appearance-rule-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "根据本任务第2步时与马欧西亚对话的见习职业队员人物造型而定",
      "type": "appearance-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "当人物造型为以下外观时，获得【闪亮之心】；其他造型获得【闪亮的白银之魂】",
      "type": "appearance-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
